WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were on hiatus
during the Winter Olympics,

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:04.304
so here with a recap is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:07.674 size:75% position:38%
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.142 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:13.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey! You guys!
The Olympics were crazy!

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:18.551
Okay, first of all, USA won its
first cross-country skiing gold,

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.853 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and I was like, "What?!"

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:23.089 size:75% position:38%
Then we won the gold
in women's hockey.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
And everyone was like,
"Wh-a-at?!"

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:30.630
Then 17-year-old Red Gerard
overslept, lost his coat,

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.798 size:75% position:38% line:92%
began in last place,

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:34.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
and ended up winning
the gold for snowboarding.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:38.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
And everyone was like,
"Wh-a-a-a-at?!"

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:39.906 size:84% position:42% line:92%
But he's a snowboarder,

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:42.442 line:92%
so he was like, "Wh-u-u-ut?"

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:46.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then he said "holy [bleep]"
on live television,

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:49.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
and everyone was like,
"[Laughing] What?"

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:54.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then the North Korean
cheer squad had everyone like,

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:55.889 line:92%
"What, what, what, what, what,

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
what, what, what, what,
what, what.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.393 line:92%
This is creeping me out."

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.829 line:92%
Then figure skater Adam Rippon

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.833
refused to meet with Mike Pence
at the opening ceremonies,

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:10.503
tweeting, "I personally have
nothing to say to Mike Pence."

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:15.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"What! Ah ha ha ha ha!

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:17.677 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Neither do I!"

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.145 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I like this guy.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:23.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I saw Adam in an
interview, and he said this.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:27.554
-28 years old. Skating the best
you ever have in your life.

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
How do you explain that
to people?

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.891 line:92%
-I can't explain witchcraft.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:34.160 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What? What?

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:38.832 line:92%
How do you explain witchcraft?

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.033 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Is it this?

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.367 size:84% position:42% line:92%
♪♪ Witch, witchcraft ♪♪

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ Is this witchcraft,
witch, witch ♪♪

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:45.872 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Scares me a little bit.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.373 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Then I saw curling,

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:50.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"WHAT is this sport?

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.414 line:92%
And why am I so drawn to it?"

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:57.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then I found out
a Russian curler was doping

00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:00.987 line:92%
and was like, "What? Why?

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:03.756 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Did you get bored?"

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:06.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then American figure skater
Nathan Chen

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
hit six quadruple turns
in his routine,

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.799 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and I was like, "What...

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.534 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What...

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.369 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What...

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:17.971 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What...

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:19.439 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Wh-a-a-a-at."

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:21.374 line:92%
Then something great happened.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:25.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
Novice skier Elizabeth Swaney
used a loophole

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:28.081
to sneak her way onto the
Hungarian Olympics team.

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:33.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was the most average
freestyle run of all time!

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.521 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look at this!

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:37.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"What are you doing?!"

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:40.226 align:start size:94% position:6%
She looks like
she fell asleep standing up

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then someone pushed her
down the halfpipe.

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:45.832 size:81% position:41%
The woman did nothing
and then had the nerve

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:49.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be mad
that she got last place.

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's what happens
when you do the least.

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:53.540 line:92%
You end up in last place.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:57.410
Then Ivanka Trump flew out
for the closing ceremonies

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
and took a picture
holding a medal.

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:01.681 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And I was like, "What?!

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:05.285 size:81% position:41%
I didn't know nepotism
was an Olympic sport."

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:07.887 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:14.460 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What.

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:19.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did she steal that medal
from that black lady?

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:21.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, I'm sorry.
Did that joke go too far?

00:03:21.935 --> 00:03:25.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause you know who liked it?
These guys.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.641 line:92%
This has been "Amber Says What."

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:31.077 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

